  "limitations": [
    "The original subnet for_each freeze loses defaults normally supplied by variable type conversion and causes an invalid-control error; it is not counted as detected.",
    "Six old gaps are rejected by the expanded suite. Three produce only assertion failures; other rejected regressions include configuration/index errors. They are not all classified as strict mutation detection.",
    "The production verifier independently detects a valid resource-group variable-wiring mutation with an actual assertion failure and no Terraform errors.",
    "Computed mock IDs are shared per resource type and cannot discriminate every possible cross-instance ID swap; alternate input keys and output key-set assertions address specific hardcoded-key regressions.",
    "Mocked plans do not establish live Azure connectivity, effective NSG security or complete behavioral coverage."
  ]
